/-- **Theorem 22C (`thm22c_pareto_frontier_4d_dominance_and_asymmetric_pebbling` — `Simplification S16` & Master `F1–F28`)**:
    Proves that:
    1. **Strict Partial Order of 4D Pareto Dominance**: `paretoDominates4DBool` is irreflexive
       (`paretoDominates4DBool p p = false`) and transitive (`paretoDominates4DBool p q = true →
       paretoDominates4DBool q r = true → paretoDominates4DBool p r = true`).
    2. **Strict Dominance of Asymmetric Královič Pebbling (`c_fwd = 1, c_rev = 0`)**:
       For all `steps > 0`, `kralovicAsymmetricToffolis steps < bennettSymmetricToffolis steps`,
       and `paretoPointKralovicChordal` strictly dominates `paretoPointBennettUnpacked` in all 4 dimensions
       (`paretoDominates4DBool paretoPointKralovicChordal paretoPointBennettUnpacked = true`) with
       `paretoPointKralovicChordal.latencyNs ≤ 1000`.
    3. **Master 28-Bug Completeness (`F1–F28`)**: All 28 adversarial bug specifications `F1..F28`
       evaluate to `.satCounterexample` while all 22 canonical `QDS-1..13` + `WS 14` + `QEC-1..8` +
       `GADGET-1..6` specifications evaluate to `.unsat` (`smtPluginCanonical28BugSuite = true`). -/
theorem thm22c_pareto_frontier_4d_dominance_and_asymmetric_pebbling
    (p q r : ParetoPoint4D) (steps : Nat) :
    steps > 0 →
    paretoDominates4DBool p p = false ∧
    (paretoDominates4DBool p q = true →
     paretoDominates4DBool q r = true →
     paretoDominates4DBool p r = true) ∧
    kralovicAsymmetricToffolis steps < bennettSymmetricToffolis steps ∧
    paretoDominates4DBool paretoPointKralovicChordal paretoPointBennettUnpacked = true ∧
    paretoPointKralovicChordal.latencyNs ≤ 1000 ∧
    checkPhase7SpecSuperoptNBE fullPhase7BugF25 = .satCounterexample ∧
    checkPhase7SpecSuperoptNBE fullPhase7BugF26 = .satCounterexample ∧
    checkPhase7SpecSuperoptNBE fullPhase7BugF27 = .satCounterexample ∧
    checkPhase7SpecSuperoptNBE fullPhase7BugF28 = .satCounterexample ∧
    smtPluginCanonical28BugSuite = true := by
  intro hSteps
  refine ⟨?_, ?_, ?_, by decide, by decide, by decide, by decide, by decide, by decide, by decide⟩
  · unfold paretoDominates4DBool
    simp only [decide_eq_false_iff_not]
    omega
  · intro hpq hqr
    unfold paretoDominates4DBool at hpq hqr ⊢
    simp only [decide_eq_true_iff] at hpq hqr ⊢
    omega
  · unfold kralovicAsymmetricToffolis bennettSymmetricToffolis
