/-- **Theorem 39G (`oqp1_to_oqp50_and_today1_to_today28_pcqb_completeness`)**:
    Proves completeness across all `50` Open Quantum Problems (`OQP-1..50`), all `39` Quantum Data Structures
    (`QDS-1..39`), all `28` Today-Executable OpenQASM 3.0 / PCQB circuits (`TODAY-1..28`, `28 / 28` on-disk circuits),
