    checkOqp1To50AndToday1To28Completeness 50 39 28 28 500 true true = false ∧
    checkOqp1To50AndToday1To28Completeness 50 39 28 28 600 false true = false := by
  refine ⟨?_, ?_, by decide, by decide, by decide, by decide, by decide, by decide⟩
  · intro id
    cases id <;> decide
  · intro id
    cases id <;> decide

