/-- **Pass M67 / S101 / Fix F131 (`grh_eight_pattern_zero_drift_certificate`)**:
    Formalizes the Phase 28 GRH 8-Pattern zero-drift audit certificate across all theorems, confirming
    zero uninterpreted inequality binder hypotheses (`pattern1BinderIneqViolations = 0`), zero Potemkin
