/-- Multi-basis equivalence probe selector (`MultiBasisProbe` — `Pass M69`, `S103`, `Fix F133`):
    - `BasisZero`: computational basis $|0\rangle^{\otimes n}$
    - `BasisPlusProbe`: non-diagonal Hadamard superposition probe $|+\rangle \otimes |+\rangle$. -/
inductive MultiBasisProbe where
  | BasisZero      : MultiBasisProbe
  | BasisPlusProbe : MultiBasisProbe
  deriving DecidableEq, Repr

/-- Multi-basis denotational output evaluator for `(oqp, basis, reg, mach, layout)` on initial state `init`
    (`evalMultiBasisTargetCell` — `Pass M69`, `S103`, `Fix F133`). -/
