/-- **(`lakefillq_egraph_saturation_module_closure`)**:
    Module closure certifying `MBU` Hadamard-dual branch equivalence, `4-CX` Heavy-Hex bridge
    commutator exactness, Berry-Gidney `QROAM` `TempAND` dominance across arbitrary word widths,
    and `verifyLakefillQEGraphSaturationModuleSanity () = true`. -/
theorem lakefillq_egraph_saturation_module_closure
    (m c1 c2 : Bool)
    (s : LakefillQEGraphQPhysSaturationProofs.Basis3)
    (wordW : Nat) :
    LakefillQEGraphQPhysSaturationProofs.mbuRawBranchSign m c1 c2 *
